* closed_loop_d8000.spice -- repeated closed-loop refresh, dwell 8000 ns x 10 cycles (longer dwell than the ratified bound (1.6x)), issue #147
* GENERATED by gen_closed_loop.py; do not edit by hand.
*
* PROPOSED/UNRATIFIED SCOPE: 27 C and 125 C, tt/ss/ff/sf/fs, VDD 1.8 V (spec/operating-range-decision-PROPOSED.md).
* One continuous transient per instance: 4 rows written ONCE through M_WR (each cell starting at the opposite of its
* data), then closed-loop refresh of every row each dwell: precharge -> select -> latch enable -> latch COMPLEMENT
* node drives WBL -> WWL pulse. No .ic reset and no ideal expected-data source after the initial write; the actual
* latch decision is written back and carried into the next cycle. Instance name <waveform>_<row0..row3 data>.
* Waveforms: ana = sim/refresh-op analog baseline; rtl = UNCHANGED phase-sequencer strobes + latch-hold adapter;
* late = EXPERIMENTAL UNAPPROVED rtl with RWL released after WWL fall; nowb = ana with write-back WWL pulses deleted.
*
* ASSUMPTIONS (labelled, none is a spec value): ideal drivers and 100 ohm switches, C_WBL = 10 fF (not extracted),
* ideal matched dummy reference load, VREF = VRBL - 100 mV, 4-row column, C_RBL = extracted 4-row worst net,
* C_SN = extracted array MINIMUM wiring C, global corners only, NO mismatch, no device-level column/row driver.

.options method=trap gmin=1e-15 abstol=1e-15 chgtol=1e-18
.param VDD   = 1.8
.param VRBL  = 0.9
.param C_RBL = 9.55559e-16   $ extracted_4row_worst_total_ff, layout/gain_cell_2t_array.parasitics.summary.json
.param C_WBL = 1e-14   $ ASSUMPTION (not extracted)
.param C_SN  = 5.38402e-16   $ comparison.c_sn.array_min_total_ff (wiring only; array-context, issue #89)
vdd   vdd 0 dc {VDD}
vprea prea 0 dc {VRBL}
vpref pref 0 dc 0.8
vrwld rwl_des 0 dc {VDD}
.model swpre sw(vt=0.9 vh=0.1 ron=100 roff=1e12)
.model swwbl sw(vt=0.9 vh=0.1 ron=100 roff=1e12)

